- **Exhibit E7 — Common target, divergent toolkit:** at IAD, designers pick ceiling systems ex ante; at DCA, retrofit means absorptive-object placement, PA re-aiming, and directional loudspeakers because ceiling replacement often isn't available. *The reason the standard is common but the prescriptions diverge.*

